sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Researcher
    participant UI as Next.js 16 UI
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Router
    participant DBM as db_manager.py
    participant SQLite as SQLite Database (mode=ro)

    User->>UI: Request Hadith Detail (/hadith/1)
    UI->>FastAPI: GET /api/hadith/1
    FastAPI->>DBM: open_readonly_connection(HADITH_KG_PATH)
    DBM->>DBM: TRACKER.register(conn)
    DBM->>SQLite: SELECT * FROM hadiths WHERE id=1
    SQLite-->>DBM: Row (matn_ar, book_id, chapter_id)
    FastAPI->>SQLite: SELECT * FROM sanads WHERE hadith_id=1
    SQLite-->>FastAPI: Sanad & Rawis Rows
    DBM->>DBM: conn.close() & TRACKER.unregister(conn)
    FastAPI-->>UI: JSON { hadith, sanads, rawis, translations }
    UI-->>User: Render Matn, Isnād & Commentary
